<title>USA: AmeriKing Inc sets $100 mln senior notes.</title>
<headline>AmeriKing Inc sets $100 mln senior notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from AmeriKing Inc was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette Securities Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER AMERKING INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.75 PCT  MATURITY 12/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 06/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD  10.75 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD N.A.	 CALLABLE  AFTER FIVE</p>
<p>								YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
